&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy influencing others and always advocate for technical excellence while being open to change when needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presence in the external tech community: you willingly share your expertise with others via speaking engagements, contributions to open source, blogs and more&lt;/li&gt;
